     2143     DISPLAY v-3 loc_use-gds-group loc_use-pay-type v-spis-group v-spis-type-pay loc_use-cash-pay v-spis-use-cash-pay F-ogran WITH FRAME page-3.
     2144     ENABLE v-3 loc_use-gds-group loc_use-pay-type v-spis-group v-spis-type-pay loc_use-cash-pay v-spis-use-cash-pay F-ogran WITH FRAME page-3.
